十五、Material 选择器和选择组件



                  概述 



本章节介绍 Material Design 中的选择器和选择组件，包括下拉选择、弹出菜单、日期时间选择器等。


1. DropdownButton
下拉按钮，用于从多个选项中选择一个。
String? _selectedItem;

DropdownButton&lt;String&gt;(
  value: _selectedItem,
  hint: Text(&#039;请选择&#039;),
  disabledHint: Text(&#039;已禁用&#039;),
  icon: Icon(Icons.arrow_downward),
  iconSize: 24,
  iconEnabledColor: Colors.blue,
  iconDisabledColor: Colors.grey,
  elevation: 8,
  style: TextStyle(color: Colors.black, fontSize: 16),
  underline: Container(
    height: 2,
    color: Colors.blue,
  ),
  isExpanded: false,  // 是否展开到父组件宽度
  dropdownColor: Colors.white,
  menuMaxHeight: 300,  // 菜单最大高度
  focusColor: Colors.blue.withOpacity(0.1),
  autofocus: false,
  onTap: () =&gt; print(&#039;Dropdown tapped&#039;),
  items: [
    DropdownMenuItem(
      value: &#039;option1&#039;,
      child: Text(&#039;选项 1&#039;),
      enabled: true,
      style: TextStyle(color: Colors.black),
    ),
    DropdownMenuItem(
      value: &#039;option2&#039;,
      child: Row(
        children: [
          Icon(Icons.star, size: 20),
          SizedBox(width: 8),
          Text(&#039;选项 2&#039;),
        ],
      ),
    ),
    DropdownMenuItem(
      value: &#039;option3&#039;,
      child: Text(&#039;选项 3&#039;),
    ),
  ],
  onChanged: (String? newValue) {
    setState(() =&gt; _selectedItem = newValue);
    print(&#039;选择了：$newValue&#039;);
  },
)
主要属性：

value: 当前选中的值
items: 下拉菜单项列表
