十六、动画 Widgets 详解



                  概述 



本章详细介绍 Flutter 中的动画组件，包括 Hero 动画、隐式动画、显式动画和各种转场动画。


1. Hero 动画
共享元素转场动画，实现页面间的平滑过渡。
// 页面 A
class PageA extends StatelessWidget {
  @override
  Widget build(BuildContext context) {
    return Scaffold(
      appBar: AppBar(title: Text(&#039;页面 A&#039;)),
      body: GestureDetector(
        onTap: () =&gt; Navigator.push(
          context,
          MaterialPageRoute(builder: (context) =&gt; PageB()),
        ),
        child: Hero(
          tag: &#039;avatar-hero&#039;,  // 必须在两个页面使用相同的 tag
          child: CircleAvatar(
            radius: 30,
            backgroundImage: NetworkImage(&#039;example.com/image.jpg&#039;),
          ),
        ),
      ),
    );
  }
}

// 页面 B
class PageB extends StatelessWidget {
  @override
  Widget build(BuildContext context) {
    return Scaffold(
      appBar: AppBar(title: Text(&#039;页面 B&#039;)),
      body: Center(
        child: Hero(
          tag: &#039;avatar-hero&#039;,
          child: CircleAvatar(
            radius: 100,  // 不同尺寸
            backgroundImage: NetworkImage(&#039;example.com/image.jpg&#039;),
          ),
        ),
      ),
    );
  }
}

// Hero 占位符
Hero(
  tag: &#039;hero-tag&#039;,
  child: Placeholder(),  // 占位符，用于延迟加载
)

// Hero 自定义动画
Hero(
  tag: &#039;custom-hero&#039;,
  placeholderBuilder: (context, size, child) {
    return Center(
      child: CircularProgressIndicator(),
    );
  },
  transitionOnUserGestures: true,  // 用户手势触发动画
  flightShuttleBuilder: (flightContext, animation, direction,
      fromContext, toContext) {
    // 自定义飞行动画
    return DefaultFlightShuttleBuilder(
      flightContext,
      animation,
      direction,
      fromContext,
      toContext,
    );
  },
  child: Image.asset(&#039;assets/image.png&#039;),
)
Hero 动画属性：

tag: 唯一标识符，两个页面必须相同
child: 要动画化的子组件
placeholderBuilder: 占位符构建器
flightShuttleBuilder: 飞行动画构建器
transitionOnUserGestures: 是否在用户手势时触发动画


2. AnimatedSwitcher
在两个子组件之间执行交叉淡入淡出动画。
bool _showFirst = true;

AnimatedSwitcher(
  duration: Duration(milliseconds: 300),
  reverseDuration: Duration(milliseconds: 300),
  switchInCurve: Curves.easeIn,
  switchOutCurve: Curves.easeOut,
  transitionBuilder: (Widget child, Animation&lt;double&gt; animation) {
    // 自定义转场动画
    return FadeTransition(
      opacity: animation,
      child: child,
    );
  },
  layoutBuilder: (Widget? currentChild, List&lt;Widget&gt; previousChildren) {
    return Stack(
      alignment: Alignment.center,
      children: &lt;Widget&gt;[
        ...previousChildren,
        if (currentChild != null) currentChild,
      ],
    );
  },
  child: _showFirst
      ? Text(&#039;First&#039;, key: ValueKey&lt;bool&gt;(true))
      : Text(&#039;Second&#039;, key: ValueKey&lt;bool&gt;(false)),
)

// 缩放切换动画
AnimatedSwitcher(
  duration: Duration(milliseconds: 300),
  transitionBuilder: (Widget child, Animation&lt;double&gt; animation) {
    return ScaleTransition(
      scale: animation,
      child: child,
    );
  },
  child: Text(
    _isActive ? &#039;激活&#039; : &#039;未激活&#039;,
    key: ValueKey&lt;bool&gt;(_isActive),
  ),
)

// 旋转切换动画
AnimatedSwitcher(
  duration: Duration(milliseconds: 500),
  transitionBuilder: (Widget child, Animation&lt;double&gt; animation) {
    return RotationTransition(
      turns: animation,
      child: child,
    );
  },
  child: Icon(
    _isPlaying ? Icons.pause : Icons.play_arrow,
    key: ValueKey&lt;bool&gt;(_isPlaying),
  ),
)

3. FadeTransition
淡入淡出转场动画。
late AnimationController _controller;
late Animation&lt;double&gt; _animation;

@override
void initState() {
  super.initState();
  _controller = AnimationController(
    vsync: this,
    duration: Duration(seconds: 2),
  );
  _animation = Tween&lt;double&gt;(
    begin: 0.0,
    end: 1.0,
  ).animate(_controller);
  _controller.forward();
}

@override
void dispose() {
  _controller.dispose();
  super.dispose();
}

@override
Widget build(BuildContext context) {
  return FadeTransition(
    opacity: _animation,
    alwaysIncludeSemantics: true,
    child: Container(
      width: 200,
      height: 200,
      color: Colors.blue,
      child: Center(child: Text(&#039;淡入淡出&#039;)),
    ),
  );
}

